<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16966" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-oscŭlor</span></b> , ātus,
		1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. dep.
				a.</i>, <i>to kiss eagerly</i>, <i>kiss fondly</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multum ac diu exosculatus adolescentem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 5, 17, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Vit. 7 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collum uxoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Calig. 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manus cum fletu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Oth. 12</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tac. H. 2, 49</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 45</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">id. A.
				1, 34</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to praise
			greatly</i>, <i>to approve</i>, <i>admire</i> a thing: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scientiam rerum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 2, 26, 20</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Sen. Contr. 1, 2, 17</span></i> B.!*? <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exoscŭlātus</span></b> ,
				a, um, in <i>pass. signif.</i>, <i>kissed</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestigia deae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 11, p. 265, 24</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manus ejus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4</span></i>
			, p. 154, 8: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 22, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
